text:
The `track` function appears twice. I will inspect the first occurrence (line 104) and the second occurrence (line 1192).

First occurrence (line 104):
```python
def track(
    self,
    sequence: Iterable[ProgressType],
    description: Optional[str] = None,
    style: Optional[StyleType] = None,
    live: Optional[Live] = None,
    update_period: float = 0.1,
    newline: Optional[str] = None,
) -> None:
    """Track a sequence of progress types."""
    self.live = live or Live(self.console)
    self.progress = self.live.progress
    self.progress.clear()
    self.progress.add_column(
        TextColumn(
            f\"[{self.progress.get_prefix()}] {description or ''}\",
            style=style,
        )
    )
    self.progress.add_column(
        TextColumn(
            f\"Progress: {self.progress.get_prefix()}/{self.progress.total}\",
            style=style,
        )
    )
    self.progress.add_column(
        TextColumn(
            f\"Time: {self.progress.elapsed}\",
            style=style,
        )
    )
